### 2. Project Identity

**Project Name:** StockMind AI

**Full Title:** AI-Powered Manufacturing Inventory Intelligence & Dead Stock Recovery Platform

**Target Industry:** Garments and Textile Manufacturing

**Initial Focus:** Knitwear and textile raw-material inventory management.

**Primary Users:**
- Factory Managers
- Inventory Managers
- Procurement Officers
- Warehouse Managers
- Production Planners
- Business Decision-Makers

**Core Vision:**

StockMind AI aims to transform traditional inventory management into intelligent inventory decision-making.

Traditional inventory systems primarily track stock quantities and movements. StockMind AI should go further by predicting inventory risks, identifying slow-moving and potentially dead stock, forecasting material demand, discovering alternative materials, and recommending ways to recover financial value from underutilized inventory.

**Core Tagline:**

"Predict the Problem. Find the Alternative. Recover the Value."

**Main Value Proposition:**

"We don't just detect inventory waste. We help businesses find ways to recover its value."

