- Supplier lead time
- Safety stock
- Incoming purchase orders
- Production commitments

Use an explainable reorder-point calculation:

Reorder Point = Average Daily Demand × Lead Time + Safety Stock

Calculate inventory coverage days and estimated stockout dates where sufficient data is available.

Provide:
